# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.

# Web3Forms access key — where the contact form sends enquiries.
#
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com/#start : enter the destination
# address (team@billservconsulting.com) and they email you a key. The free
# tier allows 250 submissions a month, which is ample here.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ means this is inlined into the client bundle, which is
# correct for this key and intentional. It is not a password: the only
# thing it permits is sending mail to the address it is registered to, so
# a scraper gains nothing. Never put an SMTP password or a Wix admin API
# key in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.
#
# Leave this unset and the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail
# client, which is what it did before the relay was added.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
